OL,3,GNEWSAPair raided 'entirely innocent'
OL,4,Aman's house
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men who kicked their way into an
OL,7,F"entirely innocent" man's home and
OL,8,Fattacked him after getting the wrong
OL,9,Faddress have been jailed.
OL,11,FJoe Murphy was looking for someone who
OL,12,Fhad stolen jewellery from him when,
OL,13,Fsupported by Alex Wild, he smashed his
OL,14,Fway into a house in Middlesbrough and
OL,15,Fpunched the victim, Teesside Crown
OL,16,FCourt heard.
OL,18,FThe victim, who was in his 50s, said
OL,19,Fthe attack was frightening and he felt
OL,20,Fhe had no choice but to leave his home
OL,21,Fof 10 years in the aftermath.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
